# Uber (Ride Matching Service)

# Monolith Archiecture

# Tech Stack
  - NodeJs
  - Express
  - Javascript
  - MongoDB
  - Redis
  - Socket (over pooling)

# Apis
  - auth
  - create ride request
  - Fare Estimation (exclude)
  - confirm booking
  - get nearby drivers
  - notify drivers
  - accept ride
  - eta calc(extact time to arrival)
  - start ride
  - complete ride
  - get ride history
